Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 13:42:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 171/172] XD Netplay: battle transcript (battle_<stamp>.txt)
 decoded from the GBA link

XD sends each GBA a turn block per decision (both sides' active Pokemon with
names, species and HP, the decider's party with HP and moves) and reads back
the GBA's choice. Collect both per socket and, when the session closes, write
each turn's moves and the HP changes over the turn. Share Log includes it.
